{
  "job_B3.4.48_20251003_114745": {
    "text": "Sermo Lupi.\nLeofan men, do\u00f0, swa ic l\u00e6re, gehyra\u00f0, hw\u00e6t ic wylle secgan to \u00feearfe, gyme se, \u00f0e cunne, his agenre\nEallum cristenum mannum is mycel \u00feearf, \u00fe\u00e6t hy godes lage fylgean and godcundre lare geornlice\nNu wylle we l\u00e6ran godes \u00feeowas georne, \u00fe\u00e6t hy hy sylfe w\u00e6rlice be\u00f0encan and \u00feurh godes fultum\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hi bocum and gebedum geornlice fylgean and bodian and bysnian godes riht georne.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hy l\u00e6ran gelome, swa hy geornost magan, \u00fe\u00e6t gehadode regollice and l\u00e6wede lahlice heora lif\nAnd ealle cristene men we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 swy\u00fee georne, \u00fe\u00e6t hy inwerdre heortan \u00e6fre god lufian and rihtne\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cristen man geleornige huru, \u00fe\u00e6t he cunne rihtne geleafan ariht understandan,\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man wi\u00f0 healice synna and wi\u00f0 deoflice d\u00e6da scylde swy\u00fee georne on \u00e6ghwylcne\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man wi\u00f0 fulne galscype and wi\u00f0 unrihth\u00e6med and wi\u00f0 \u00e6ghwylcne \u00e6wbrice warnie\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 and bidda\u00f0 and on godes naman beoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig cristen man binnan syx manna\nNe on \u00e6l\u00e6tan \u00e6nig cristen man ne gewifige \u00e6fre ne na ma wifa, \u00feonne an, h\u00e6bbe, ac beo be \u00f0\u00e6re anre\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 eac georne manna gehwylcne, \u00fe\u00e6t he godes ege h\u00e6bbe symle on gemynde and d\u00e6ges\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 swy\u00fee georne freonda gehwylcne, \u00fe\u00e6t he fram synnum georne gecyrre and o\u00f0rum\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hy godcundan lareowan geornlice hyran and godes larum and lagum geornlice fylgean.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hy godes cyrcan \u00e6ghw\u00e6r georne gri\u00f0ian and fri\u00f0ian and mid leohte and lacum hy gelome\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hy godes gerihta \u00e6ghwylce geare mid rihte gel\u00e6stan and freolsa and f\u00e6stena rihtlice healdan.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hy sunnandaga cypinga and folcgemota on \u00feam halgan d\u00e6ge georne geswican.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hi godes \u00feeowas symle werian and weor\u00f0ian.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hy godes \u00feearfan frefrian and fedan.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hi wydewan and steopcild to oft ne ahw\u00e6nan, ac georne hy gladian.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hi el\u00f0eodige menn and feorran cumene ne tyrian ne ne tynan.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hi o\u00f0rum mannum unriht ne beodan ealles to swy\u00f0e, ac manna gehwylc o\u00f0rum beode \u00fe\u00e6t riht,\nA sy godes nama ecelice gebletsod and hym symle sy wuldor and weor\u00f0mynt \u00e6fre to worolde.",
